[00:07.24] In the dark of night...
[00:09.94] Abusing a portion of light
[00:12.81] While others are sleeping and some are escaping
[00:18.47] A serpent spews out fantasy
[00:21.69] Unjustified blasphemy
[00:24.36] That cannot be condoned
[00:46.90] It must be strange to not have lived
[00:49.77] So far into existence
[01:13.06] This is not a test of power
[01:18.89] This is not a game to be lost or won
[01:25.84] Let justice be done
[01:38.92] There will be zero tolerance
[01:47.92] For the creator of hallowed intentions
[01:57.08] There will be zero tolerance
[02:02.37] Fate is your deciding God
[03:25.95] Karma comes crashing down leaving a very deep scar
[03:31.56] Exposing a door to the source of a verbal whore
[03:39.85] Machines supply the altar
[03:42.44] Where virtuous lives are sacrificed
[04:04.30] It must be strange to not have lived
[04:07.26] So far into existence
[04:30.42] This is not a test of power
[04:36.07] This is not a game to be lost or won
